1
00:00:01,290 --> 00:00:04,500
[♪ opening theme song playing]

2
00:01:29,880 --> 00:01:32,260
[phone vibrating]

3
00:01:34,550 --> 00:01:35,720
[TACHIKAWA] Hello?

4
00:01:36,680 --> 00:01:38,680
Yeah, I'm at work right now.

5
00:01:38,970 --> 00:01:41,140
Yeah, everything
will be all right.

6
00:01:43,060 --> 00:01:45,480
Hey, Gabby,
why don't we take a break also?

7
00:01:46,110 --> 00:01:47,690
Oh, right, forgot.

8
00:01:47,820 --> 00:01:49,360
She had a job to do.

9
00:01:50,650 --> 00:01:53,280
Oh, wow, you're all by yourself.

10
00:01:53,410 --> 00:01:54,910
Miss Gabby's so protective,

11
00:01:55,030 --> 00:01:56,910
she's normally
stuck to you like glue.

12
00:01:57,030 --> 00:01:59,120
This is a rare sight, isn't it?

13
00:01:59,700 --> 00:02:01,830
How about I stay
to keep you safe?

14
00:02:02,460 --> 00:02:04,000
Hey, Akio?

15
00:02:04,460 --> 00:02:05,750
You look strange.

16
00:02:05,880 --> 00:02:07,630
Are you hiding something?

17
00:02:08,420 --> 00:02:09,670
Akio?

18
00:02:11,970 --> 00:02:15,010
Uh, no, I'm actually fine
by myself.

19
00:02:15,130 --> 00:02:16,840
I said I'm okay.

20
00:02:16,970 --> 00:02:19,390
Hold on. Stop!

21
00:02:20,350 --> 00:02:22,640
'Cause if you get closer...

22
00:02:26,770 --> 00:02:28,310
[man 1 screams]

23
00:02:28,440 --> 00:02:30,190
-[thudding]
-[man 2 screams]

24
00:02:30,320 --> 00:02:31,740
[man 3 panting]

25
00:02:33,820 --> 00:02:35,860
Shit, shit, shit, shit!

26
00:02:36,280 --> 00:02:38,990
This is bad. The Kagemori clan's
head is here!

27
00:02:39,120 --> 00:02:41,160
-[grunts]
-Are you for real?

28
00:02:41,290 --> 00:02:43,160
[man 3 pants]
Yeah! He's going around

29
00:02:43,290 --> 00:02:45,580
smashing up any office
affiliated with Shingo.

30
00:02:45,710 --> 00:02:46,630
By himself!

31
00:02:46,750 --> 00:02:48,000
[ALL] He's what?

32
00:02:48,130 --> 00:02:51,050
[MAN 4] Crap. And you know
he'll have backup!

33
00:02:51,170 --> 00:02:54,090
Natsuki and Fuyuki are always
shadowing him.

34
00:02:54,220 --> 00:02:55,930
They've gotta be nearby!

35
00:02:56,340 --> 00:02:58,220
[MAN 3]
Gonzo's a serious threat,

36
00:02:58,340 --> 00:03:00,810
but Blacklist is scary
in a whole different way!

37
00:03:00,930 --> 00:03:01,930
If they catch us,

38
00:03:02,060 --> 00:03:03,980
they'll wring us
for all the info we have!

39
00:03:04,100 --> 00:03:05,020
[all trembling]

40
00:03:05,140 --> 00:03:06,350
[scoffs]

41
00:03:06,480 --> 00:03:08,020
Though, if we killed Fuyuki

42
00:03:08,150 --> 00:03:09,610
and became
their new master, then...

43
00:03:09,730 --> 00:03:12,480
Right. Whisper's treasure trove
of information

44
00:03:12,610 --> 00:03:13,570
would become ours.

45
00:03:14,070 --> 00:03:16,910
I've got Shingo's bounty ranking
that he sent us.

46
00:03:17,030 --> 00:03:19,490
For Fuyuki's head
and the capture of Blacklist,

47
00:03:19,620 --> 00:03:22,580
-it's 100 million!
-You're kidding me.

48
00:03:22,700 --> 00:03:24,870
Always knew Shingo
was a generous man.

49
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:28,040
And you know, Fuyuki's daemons
aren't fighters.

50
00:03:28,170 --> 00:03:29,380
We could take them easy.

51
00:03:29,880 --> 00:03:32,960
Maybe, but Natsuki's daemons
are supposed to be tough.

52
00:03:33,090 --> 00:03:34,970
There's no way
they'd be strong enough

53
00:03:35,090 --> 00:03:37,130
to handle all of us
at the same time.

54
00:03:37,260 --> 00:03:38,930
-Wanna try?
-Of course.

55
00:03:39,050 --> 00:03:40,260
Let's go!

56
00:03:40,390 --> 00:03:42,140
[ALL] Yeah!

57
00:03:43,390 --> 00:03:44,720
[MAN 1] Hmm...

58
00:03:45,270 --> 00:03:47,640
I've got eyes
on Natsuki and Fuyuki.

59
00:03:47,770 --> 00:03:49,810
They're on top
of the distro center.

60
00:03:51,730 --> 00:03:53,270
Circle around back!

61
00:03:57,030 --> 00:03:59,660
[monsters growling]

62
00:04:00,620 --> 00:04:02,200
[MAN 1] Kill Fuyuki first.

63
00:04:02,320 --> 00:04:04,200
We need to get Blacklist.

64
00:04:04,330 --> 00:04:05,870
[monsters yelling]

65
00:04:13,710 --> 00:04:16,300
[monsters scream]

66
00:04:20,430 --> 00:04:21,470
[gasps]

67
00:04:21,590 --> 00:04:23,100
[groans]

68
00:04:23,220 --> 00:04:24,720
[all screaming]

69
00:04:25,600 --> 00:04:27,100
[footsteps]

70
00:04:34,980 --> 00:04:36,110
♪

71
00:04:36,440 --> 00:04:40,610
[ASA] Yin, Yang, it's fine.
You can come out now.

72
00:04:40,990 --> 00:04:42,530
[Ohagi and Daifuku exclaiming]

73
00:04:49,830 --> 00:04:51,040
[Akio gasps]

74
00:04:56,710 --> 00:05:00,130
I tried to warn you
to stay away, Akio.

75
00:05:00,260 --> 00:05:04,640
Because now you've
stepped into my reach.

76
00:05:14,060 --> 00:05:15,190
[JIN] Ai, dear?

77
00:05:15,900 --> 00:05:18,400
I don't want you eating
any more of him.

78
00:05:18,530 --> 00:05:20,030
We need him alive to talk.

79
00:05:21,820 --> 00:05:22,990
[Akio sighs]

80
00:05:24,070 --> 00:05:26,320
[AKIO] So when did you
figure me out?

81
00:05:28,290 --> 00:05:30,540
I was suspicious
when we fought Yuru.

82
00:05:30,660 --> 00:05:32,960
Even though I was in charge,

83
00:05:33,080 --> 00:05:34,920
he didn't try
to attack me first.

84
00:05:35,040 --> 00:05:38,460
Not even Haruo, whose daemons
were causing him some trouble.

85
00:05:38,840 --> 00:05:42,380
Instead, he picked the man
who was unarmed and daemon-less.

86
00:05:42,510 --> 00:05:44,050
And went for your head.

87
00:05:45,930 --> 00:05:48,260
That kid, when someone
wants him dead,

88
00:05:48,390 --> 00:05:50,850
he'll respond in his own way.

89
00:05:52,390 --> 00:05:55,020
Yuru got a sense
you wanted to kill him.

90
00:05:55,400 --> 00:05:58,730
And then you bumped off the guy
who led the attack on our manor.

91
00:05:58,860 --> 00:06:01,030
I figured you wanted
to silence him.

92
00:06:01,240 --> 00:06:04,160
So I laid a trap for you,
and here we are.

93
00:06:04,570 --> 00:06:05,620
Want some coffee?

94
00:06:05,740 --> 00:06:08,490
No, thanks. I'm wide awake now.

95
00:06:08,790 --> 00:06:10,790
How'd you know
about the warehouse?

96
00:06:10,910 --> 00:06:13,040
Did your new contact
with Higashi Village

97
00:06:13,170 --> 00:06:14,330
leak that one to you?

98
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:17,250
There's a shock.
I never thought I'd see the day

99
00:06:17,380 --> 00:06:19,340
when you'd start palling around
with those guys.

100
00:06:19,460 --> 00:06:21,130
[JIN] We're not pals.

101
00:06:22,300 --> 00:06:23,800
[HARUO] Sorry, Akio.

102
00:06:24,630 --> 00:06:27,180
If you're looking
for Asa, she's out.

103
00:06:27,970 --> 00:06:31,100
Even if we don't share blood,
we are still brothers.

104
00:06:31,220 --> 00:06:32,770
I trusted you.

105
00:06:33,560 --> 00:06:36,310
Please don't put up
a fight, okay?

106
00:06:36,440 --> 00:06:38,610
This doesn't have to get worse.

107
00:06:38,730 --> 00:06:41,940
Give up. Beg the master
for your life!

108
00:06:42,490 --> 00:06:45,110
I will be there too.
On my hands and knees!

109
00:06:45,240 --> 00:06:46,570
No point.

110
00:06:46,700 --> 00:06:48,910
You know he's not gonna
forgive me after this.

111
00:06:49,030 --> 00:06:50,660
[Haruo sighs]

112
00:06:50,790 --> 00:06:52,450
[creaking]

113
00:06:52,580 --> 00:06:53,700
[Jin exhales]

114
00:06:54,210 --> 00:06:57,920
[AKIO] But man,
you guys really thought ahead.

115
00:06:58,290 --> 00:07:00,500
Asa's not even
in the manor, huh?

116
00:07:01,630 --> 00:07:02,920
[sighs]

117
00:07:03,050 --> 00:07:04,670
That only leaves me one option.

118
00:07:04,800 --> 00:07:06,260
Turn this whole place to rubble

119
00:07:06,380 --> 00:07:08,720
so she's got
nowhere left to hide.

120
00:07:08,850 --> 00:07:10,260
-[creaking]
-[JIN] Mm?

121
00:07:10,470 --> 00:07:12,470
[AKIO] Mountain God are
far too big of daemons

122
00:07:12,600 --> 00:07:14,310
for Ai to swallow whole.

123
00:07:15,100 --> 00:07:18,650
Not even Haruo's tortoise
can fully shut them down.

124
00:07:19,310 --> 00:07:21,900
I don't think we have a way
to catch the hare,

125
00:07:22,020 --> 00:07:24,320
but elephants don't worry
about flies.

126
00:07:25,280 --> 00:07:28,530
Do you really want to fight me?
You're sure?

127
00:07:30,450 --> 00:07:31,620
[GABBY] Sounds fun.

128
00:07:31,740 --> 00:07:35,250
Let me play.
I'm itchin' for a fight.

129
00:07:37,540 --> 00:07:38,710
[Akio gasps]

130
00:07:39,130 --> 00:07:42,420
[AKIO] No. I saw Gabby
go to the warehouse.

131
00:07:43,300 --> 00:07:46,050
I get it.
They've gotta be bluffing.

132
00:07:46,430 --> 00:07:47,840
It's a daemon.

133
00:07:48,130 --> 00:07:52,140
Tachikawa told us her fox daemon
can transform into people.

134
00:07:52,260 --> 00:07:55,350
It's standing in darkness
to hide its missing shadow.

135
00:07:57,480 --> 00:07:58,850
[Akio gasps]

136
00:07:59,440 --> 00:08:01,480
[GABBY] I can legit see
your mind racing,

137
00:08:01,610 --> 00:08:04,730
trying to figure out how this
whole thing's one big bluff.

138
00:08:05,030 --> 00:08:06,610
Well, stop your thinkin'.

139
00:08:07,110 --> 00:08:08,990
'Cause I got news, you shithead.

140
00:08:09,450 --> 00:08:11,410
We're the real deal!

141
00:08:13,290 --> 00:08:15,750
Wow, what a haul we've got.

142
00:08:15,870 --> 00:08:17,790
Finished down there?

143
00:08:17,910 --> 00:08:19,120
Well done, sir.

144
00:08:19,250 --> 00:08:20,920
Down we go.

145
00:08:21,040 --> 00:08:23,960
Just for now,
I'll take all of them, okay?

146
00:08:24,090 --> 00:08:25,130
Please.

147
00:08:25,500 --> 00:08:28,930
Great. Come on, kids,
meet your new master.

148
00:08:30,630 --> 00:08:34,390
[hums]

149
00:08:37,930 --> 00:08:39,350
♪

150
00:08:43,560 --> 00:08:45,020
Welcome to the family.

151
00:08:45,150 --> 00:08:47,320
I do hope
you'll enjoy your stay.

152
00:08:48,240 --> 00:08:50,700
[monsters exclaiming]

153
00:09:01,170 --> 00:09:02,540
[laughs]

154
00:09:02,670 --> 00:09:05,540
Good! Come to papa!
Aw, there, there!

155
00:09:05,670 --> 00:09:08,050
[Gonzo laughs]

156
00:09:08,170 --> 00:09:11,180
-What the hell?
-Old man took my daemons!

157
00:09:11,300 --> 00:09:13,680
Impossible.
What about their compatibility?

158
00:09:13,800 --> 00:09:15,760
[MAN 2]
That's way too many pairs!

159
00:09:15,890 --> 00:09:17,470
How can he have
such a massive horde

160
00:09:17,600 --> 00:09:19,640
and not deal
with constant infighting?

161
00:09:19,770 --> 00:09:21,020
♪

162
00:09:22,560 --> 00:09:24,360
[NARRATOR]
Gonzo's main daemon pair

163
00:09:24,480 --> 00:09:26,070
is Hyakki Yako.

164
00:09:26,190 --> 00:09:29,190
Compatibility is often
an issue when one attempts

165
00:09:29,320 --> 00:09:31,650
to command multiple
pairs of daemons.

166
00:09:31,780 --> 00:09:35,410
Daemons have minds of their own,
so just like anyone else,

167
00:09:35,530 --> 00:09:37,780
they may or may not
get along with others

168
00:09:37,910 --> 00:09:40,120
when they're forced
into close proximity.

169
00:09:40,250 --> 00:09:42,660
If two contracted pairs
are incompatible,

170
00:09:42,790 --> 00:09:44,170
there may be infighting.

171
00:09:44,290 --> 00:09:47,250
Or worst case, they could bring
harm to their master.

172
00:09:47,380 --> 00:09:49,630
Luckily, that's not
a problem here.

173
00:09:49,750 --> 00:09:52,880
Because there's a daemon pair
made to preserve harmony!

174
00:09:53,010 --> 00:09:55,550
And their name... Hyakki Yako!

175
00:09:55,680 --> 00:09:58,260
There's no need
to worry about compatibility,

176
00:09:58,390 --> 00:10:00,430
because with the help
of these daemons,

177
00:10:00,560 --> 00:10:03,230
Gonzo Kagemori can form
peaceful contracts

178
00:10:03,350 --> 00:10:04,850
with as many pairs as he'd like.

179
00:10:04,980 --> 00:10:07,650
They use Break to make
tons of stray daemons,

180
00:10:07,770 --> 00:10:09,980
then let Gonzo Kagemori
collect them all.

181
00:10:10,110 --> 00:10:11,740
And then with Blacklist,

182
00:10:11,860 --> 00:10:14,780
Fuyuki can extract all of our
information with ease!

183
00:10:15,240 --> 00:10:18,280
[BOTH MEN] Could any combo
be scarier than that?

184
00:10:18,830 --> 00:10:20,790
[SHINGO] What? Break's there?

185
00:10:21,200 --> 00:10:24,750
I knew to expect the clan head,
some Kuroyas, and Gabby.

186
00:10:24,870 --> 00:10:25,880
But nobody mentioned

187
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:26,960
-Asa coming!
-[YURU] Hm?

188
00:10:27,090 --> 00:10:29,500
Asuma, did you lie to me?

189
00:10:29,630 --> 00:10:32,510
I swear I did not.
I'm surprised, quite.

190
00:10:32,630 --> 00:10:35,010
[Shingo scoffs] Wait.
Where's Ivan?

191
00:10:35,130 --> 00:10:36,050
[YURU] Hmm.

192
00:10:36,600 --> 00:10:38,220
-[SHINGO] Sic him on Gonzo.
-[YURU] Asa showed up, too?

193
00:10:38,350 --> 00:10:40,140
[SHINGO] What? He's not there.

194
00:10:40,510 --> 00:10:41,930
That bastard.

195
00:10:42,060 --> 00:10:44,180
What does he think
I'm paying him for?

196
00:10:45,190 --> 00:10:46,810
[Shingo grunting]

197
00:10:48,980 --> 00:10:51,280
[YURU] I don't wanna see
either of you move.

198
00:10:53,400 --> 00:10:56,160
Take one step towards me,
and your uncle's dead.

199
00:10:56,280 --> 00:10:58,530
[MAN ON PHONE] You still there,
Shingo? Something wrong?

200
00:10:58,660 --> 00:11:00,580
[YURU] I'm gonna borrow
this "smartphone" thing.

201
00:11:01,580 --> 00:11:03,330
Don't mind, do you?

202
00:11:03,460 --> 00:11:04,540
♪

203
00:11:12,380 --> 00:11:14,670
-[Akai groans]
-[AKIO] Now I see.

204
00:11:15,220 --> 00:11:17,430
Makoto Tachikawa's daemon
is the one

205
00:11:17,550 --> 00:11:18,970
who went to the warehouse.

206
00:11:19,430 --> 00:11:22,260
As it turns out,
shapeshifters are always useful.

207
00:11:22,390 --> 00:11:23,980
She opened up options for us.

208
00:11:24,520 --> 00:11:25,730
Moments ago,

209
00:11:25,850 --> 00:11:28,060
I called her pretending
to be a younger brother.

210
00:11:28,190 --> 00:11:30,860
It was really just an excuse
to leave the room.

211
00:11:30,980 --> 00:11:33,030
Luckily,
she's a good actress, too.

212
00:11:33,150 --> 00:11:35,820
And here I was, thinking Asa
had just been left alone

213
00:11:35,950 --> 00:11:37,110
at the perfect time.

214
00:11:37,240 --> 00:11:39,530
I fell for it hook, line,
and sinker.

215
00:11:40,280 --> 00:11:42,240
-[Gabriel growls]
-How unfortunate.

216
00:11:42,370 --> 00:11:44,500
I hate it when women lie.

217
00:11:45,580 --> 00:11:47,790
So you're really goin' through
with this, huh?

218
00:11:48,960 --> 00:11:50,460
Did you forget who it was

219
00:11:50,590 --> 00:11:53,920
that messed up
your daemon's horn, Akio?

220
00:11:54,050 --> 00:11:55,380
[Gabriel growls]

221
00:11:57,840 --> 00:11:59,180
[Gabriel grunts]

222
00:11:59,300 --> 00:12:01,510
[GABBY] Pretty sure I made it
crystal clear

223
00:12:01,640 --> 00:12:05,140
when we first met
which one of us is stronger!

224
00:12:12,270 --> 00:12:16,400
Let's turn this Mountain God
to a patch of dirt, Gabriel.

225
00:12:16,990 --> 00:12:19,910
Jinny! You're on cleanup duty!

226
00:12:20,370 --> 00:12:22,200
I can take care of that.

227
00:12:22,530 --> 00:12:26,000
But you're not to kill Akio
or his daemons.

228
00:12:26,790 --> 00:12:28,460
[Gabby breathes heavily]

229
00:12:30,330 --> 00:12:32,920
I ain't about to make
any promises.

230
00:12:35,880 --> 00:12:37,590
[rumbling]

231
00:12:39,630 --> 00:12:41,640
[objects clattering]

232
00:12:46,520 --> 00:12:47,730
[SERVANT] What's that?

233
00:12:49,230 --> 00:12:51,480
[both talking gibberish]

234
00:12:51,600 --> 00:12:52,690
-[TACHIKAWA] All of you, run!
-[BOTH] Uh?

235
00:12:52,810 --> 00:12:54,150
We need to get out!

236
00:12:54,270 --> 00:12:56,740
-What's going on?
-Is something wrong?

237
00:12:56,860 --> 00:12:58,950
[TACHIKAWA] Orders from Jin!
Get as far away

238
00:12:59,070 --> 00:13:00,990
from Hagure-sensei's annex
as you can!

239
00:13:01,110 --> 00:13:03,320
Spread the word to anyone else
you can find!

240
00:13:03,450 --> 00:13:04,530
-But why?
-[rumbling]

241
00:13:04,660 --> 00:13:05,620
[all gasp]

242
00:13:11,250 --> 00:13:12,420
[SERVANT] Whoa!

243
00:13:13,000 --> 00:13:15,170
Akio let Mountain God come out?

244
00:13:15,420 --> 00:13:18,000
Did assassins
break into the manor again?

245
00:13:18,550 --> 00:13:20,300
They didn't "break in."

246
00:13:20,840 --> 00:13:23,470
-They were already inside.
-Huh?

247
00:13:23,600 --> 00:13:24,720
♪

248
00:13:24,850 --> 00:13:27,010
[TACHIKAWA]
They have been for a while.

249
00:13:27,350 --> 00:13:28,770
[Gabriel growling]

250
00:13:32,440 --> 00:13:34,310
[Yamakaze groans]

251
00:13:36,690 --> 00:13:38,490
[Gabriel growling]

252
00:13:38,610 --> 00:13:40,150
[Tanikaze grunting]

253
00:13:48,290 --> 00:13:50,910
[AKIO] Our matchup
against Gabriel is rather poor.

254
00:13:51,410 --> 00:13:55,130
Yamakaze, take out
Miss Gabby first.

255
00:13:56,750 --> 00:13:58,000
Crap!

256
00:14:04,840 --> 00:14:06,720
Hey, Chompers, what you doing?

257
00:14:06,850 --> 00:14:08,560
Don't lose your head
over your enemy.

258
00:14:08,680 --> 00:14:10,850
You've gotta make sure
your master stays safe.

259
00:14:10,980 --> 00:14:14,390
I swear, the two of you always
get too hot and mad.

260
00:14:14,520 --> 00:14:15,940
[Gabriel grunting]

261
00:14:16,480 --> 00:14:18,400
[AKIO] What's he up to?

262
00:14:18,520 --> 00:14:19,690
[Akio grunts]

263
00:14:21,440 --> 00:14:22,490
Tanikaze!

264
00:14:24,700 --> 00:14:26,280
[grunting]

265
00:14:26,410 --> 00:14:28,030
[Tanikaze growling]

266
00:14:31,500 --> 00:14:32,540
[HARUO] Tordy!

267
00:14:32,660 --> 00:14:34,040
[BUNBUN] He couldn't even
slow 'em down!

268
00:14:34,160 --> 00:14:35,420
[Gabriel growls]

269
00:14:37,340 --> 00:14:40,000
[GABBY] Get ready!
Once we've eaten them,

270
00:14:40,130 --> 00:14:41,670
we're comin' for you next!

271
00:14:41,800 --> 00:14:43,090
Leave them alive.

272
00:14:43,220 --> 00:14:45,050
Don't disregard my orders,
Gabby!

273
00:14:45,180 --> 00:14:46,800
Why? They're gonna be dead meat

274
00:14:46,930 --> 00:14:49,300
as soon as the Master
gets home, anyway!

275
00:14:55,140 --> 00:14:57,230
[JIN] At the rate
this fight is going,

276
00:14:57,360 --> 00:14:59,230
Hagure's gonna kill all of us.

277
00:15:00,610 --> 00:15:03,150
[Hagure snores]

278
00:15:04,070 --> 00:15:05,450
[GABBY]
Now, what came out of that

279
00:15:05,570 --> 00:15:07,280
piece of shit mouth earlier?

280
00:15:07,410 --> 00:15:09,700
Something about
turning this place to rubble

281
00:15:09,830 --> 00:15:12,790
so Asa's got
nowhere left to hide? Yeah?

282
00:15:14,370 --> 00:15:16,210
You'll eat those words.

283
00:15:16,540 --> 00:15:18,080
From the moment she was born,

284
00:15:18,210 --> 00:15:20,210
some lousy adults
wanted her dead!

285
00:15:20,340 --> 00:15:22,670
Her own village locked her away
in a cell!

286
00:15:22,800 --> 00:15:26,130
She was cut off from the world
with no chance of freedom.

287
00:15:26,260 --> 00:15:27,890
[Gabriel growling]

288
00:15:28,010 --> 00:15:29,680
[GABBY] Even when
she managed to escape

289
00:15:29,800 --> 00:15:31,930
that disgusting place
with her parents,

290
00:15:32,060 --> 00:15:34,180
people were still trying
to kill her here!

291
00:15:34,310 --> 00:15:37,140
And when she thought she'd found
safety in this manor,

292
00:15:37,270 --> 00:15:39,190
her parents were kidnapped.

293
00:15:39,310 --> 00:15:41,650
She can't even turn
to her grandma anymore!

294
00:15:41,770 --> 00:15:45,450
This is the only place
Asa has left to go!

295
00:15:45,570 --> 00:15:47,530
These walls
don't offer her much,

296
00:15:47,650 --> 00:15:50,740
but at least she has the
teensiest bit of freedom here!

297
00:15:50,870 --> 00:15:53,950
So finally, finally, she's found
somewhere safe

298
00:15:54,080 --> 00:15:55,160
she can live her life.

299
00:15:55,290 --> 00:15:58,330
And you wanna take that away
from her, too?

300
00:15:58,460 --> 00:16:03,090
If you think you're getting away
with that, think again!

301
00:16:04,300 --> 00:16:06,420
[Gabriel growling]

302
00:16:27,280 --> 00:16:29,030
We're done.

303
00:16:29,490 --> 00:16:31,830
[Yamakaze groans]

304
00:16:32,450 --> 00:16:34,870
Yamakaze, Tanikaze,

305
00:16:35,370 --> 00:16:38,000
there's no point in you
going down here with me.

306
00:16:39,500 --> 00:16:41,460
You two should go home.

307
00:16:41,750 --> 00:16:43,750
I'm ending our contract.

308
00:16:47,970 --> 00:16:49,590
[GABBY] They're escaping.

309
00:16:50,380 --> 00:16:52,220
[JIN] Did you forget, Akio?

310
00:16:52,970 --> 00:16:55,720
There's a barrier here.
It goes both ways.

311
00:17:06,570 --> 00:17:08,530
We'll collect them later.

312
00:17:09,070 --> 00:17:10,400
[Akio grunts]

313
00:17:11,200 --> 00:17:12,530
Akio.

314
00:17:15,580 --> 00:17:18,620
[Gabriel growling]

315
00:17:20,290 --> 00:17:22,040
-No, don't!
-Please, Gabby!

316
00:17:22,170 --> 00:17:23,670
-Dummy!
-[GABBY] Gobble.

317
00:17:23,790 --> 00:17:24,840
[Akio gasps]

318
00:17:30,840 --> 00:17:33,430
[Jijimaru and Babamaru
grunting]

319
00:17:35,890 --> 00:17:37,470
[Akio breathes shakily]

320
00:17:46,190 --> 00:17:49,030
[BABAMARU]
Any naughty children about?

321
00:17:49,780 --> 00:17:52,570
[JIJIMARU]
Any crybabies about?

322
00:17:55,030 --> 00:17:56,990
[Gabby grunts]

323
00:17:57,120 --> 00:18:00,370
[NATSUKI] You can't just
kill him, Gabby. Bad girl.

324
00:18:00,500 --> 00:18:01,620
[Gabby grunts]

325
00:18:02,750 --> 00:18:05,000
Don't try to stop me, Natsuki.

326
00:18:05,500 --> 00:18:06,750
[NATSUKI] Cool down.

327
00:18:07,420 --> 00:18:10,090
Asa didn't ask you
to do this for her.

328
00:18:10,210 --> 00:18:12,050
Don't just assume
what she wants.

329
00:18:12,170 --> 00:18:13,340
[Gabby scoffs]

330
00:18:13,720 --> 00:18:16,050
[BABAMARU] Any crybabies about?

331
00:18:17,930 --> 00:18:21,770
Yeah, all right.
Don't gotta tell me twice.

332
00:18:22,020 --> 00:18:24,560
He can walk away
with his life for now.

333
00:18:25,900 --> 00:18:27,020
[Akio gasps]

334
00:18:27,150 --> 00:18:29,530
[JIJIMARU]
Any naughty children about?

335
00:18:29,980 --> 00:18:32,950
[AKIO] Natsuki and Namomihagi
were on deck, too?

336
00:18:35,360 --> 00:18:38,700
You had yourself, Haruo,
Miss Gabby, and Natsuki.

337
00:18:38,950 --> 00:18:42,410
How many people were you willing
to dedicate to fight one guy?

338
00:18:42,540 --> 00:18:46,000
I went all out because I'm aware
of how strong you are.

339
00:18:46,130 --> 00:18:48,130
My job
was to bring you in alive,

340
00:18:48,250 --> 00:18:50,130
and I planned accordingly.

341
00:18:50,250 --> 00:18:52,760
I couldn't afford
to skimp on firepower.

342
00:18:53,090 --> 00:18:54,840
Someone would have died.

343
00:18:55,800 --> 00:18:57,390
I'm honored, sir.

344
00:18:57,510 --> 00:19:00,060
I didn't realize you thought
so highly of me.

345
00:19:02,180 --> 00:19:03,310
[Haruo gasps]

346
00:19:04,100 --> 00:19:05,060
[HARUO] Uh?

347
00:19:05,190 --> 00:19:07,560
Wait, Akio! Come back!

348
00:19:08,110 --> 00:19:10,730
[BABAMARU]
Should we not give chase?

349
00:19:10,860 --> 00:19:11,820
It's fine.

350
00:19:12,400 --> 00:19:13,780
He can't escape.

351
00:19:14,240 --> 00:19:15,320
He's about to learn

352
00:19:15,450 --> 00:19:17,570
there are some fates
worse than death.

353
00:19:21,490 --> 00:19:24,330
[AKIO] They're not pursuing me?
That's weird.

354
00:19:24,450 --> 00:19:25,710
♪

355
00:19:28,790 --> 00:19:29,960
[AKIO] Uh?

356
00:19:33,840 --> 00:19:36,470
Makoto Tachikawa and...

357
00:19:37,300 --> 00:19:39,760
[Midori vocalizing]

358
00:19:40,100 --> 00:19:42,680
[Akio gasps, grunts]

359
00:19:43,060 --> 00:19:44,390
♪

360
00:19:48,860 --> 00:19:50,020
[AKIO] Balls.

361
00:19:50,150 --> 00:19:51,230
♪

362
00:19:52,480 --> 00:19:53,860
[AKIO] This sucks.

363
00:19:53,980 --> 00:19:55,110
[splattering]

364
00:19:55,240 --> 00:19:56,700
-[MAN ON PHONE] Shingo?
-[Shingo grunting]

365
00:19:56,820 --> 00:19:58,070
Are you there? Shingo!

366
00:19:58,200 --> 00:20:01,580
-So, uh, what now?
-Hello?

367
00:20:01,700 --> 00:20:03,370
-Do I just talk into this thing?
-What's happening?

368
00:20:03,490 --> 00:20:04,870
That's right.

369
00:20:05,000 --> 00:20:07,580
Careful not to touch the screen
or you may hang up.

370
00:20:07,710 --> 00:20:09,080
[YURU] Hey, watch those hands.

371
00:20:09,210 --> 00:20:10,790
I said I'd kill him
if you moved.

372
00:20:10,920 --> 00:20:12,290
Sorry, of course.

373
00:20:13,050 --> 00:20:16,010
Though you'd be doing me a favor
if you did kill him.

374
00:20:16,460 --> 00:20:18,220
Huh? What'd you say?

375
00:20:18,800 --> 00:20:20,140
Oh, nothing.

376
00:20:20,390 --> 00:20:22,010
Can you hear me?

377
00:20:22,140 --> 00:20:24,060
You're one of Shingo's guys,
aren't you?

378
00:20:24,180 --> 00:20:25,930
-What? Who's this?
-Me.

379
00:20:26,060 --> 00:20:27,270
"Me" who?

380
00:20:27,390 --> 00:20:29,190
I'm the twin
your boss kidnapped.

381
00:20:29,310 --> 00:20:31,110
It's Yuru from Higashi.

382
00:20:31,230 --> 00:20:34,030
What? How'd that kid get a hold
of Shingo's phone?

383
00:20:34,150 --> 00:20:36,940
[YURU] I've taken
the old man hostage.

384
00:20:37,070 --> 00:20:39,360
His life is literally
in my hands.

385
00:20:39,490 --> 00:20:40,450
What?

386
00:20:40,570 --> 00:20:42,410
[ASUMA]
Spoken like a true villain.

387
00:20:42,530 --> 00:20:44,830
You're gonna release the kids
you're keeping there,

388
00:20:44,950 --> 00:20:46,870
assuming you don't want me
to crush his windpipe.

389
00:20:47,000 --> 00:20:47,910
The hell's your deal?

390
00:20:48,040 --> 00:20:49,120
[Shingo grunts]

391
00:20:49,250 --> 00:20:50,670
No, Shingo!

392
00:20:50,790 --> 00:20:52,920
What are you doing, brat?
I'll kill you!

393
00:20:53,420 --> 00:20:56,880
Sure, fine. You want me dead,
come and get me.

394
00:20:57,010 --> 00:20:58,130
[Shingo grunts]

395
00:20:58,340 --> 00:21:01,220
Jeez. You know,
you're one freaky kid.

396
00:21:01,930 --> 00:21:03,010
Fujin.

397
00:21:03,680 --> 00:21:05,310
[Yuru gasps, grunts]

398
00:21:10,770 --> 00:21:12,900
[YURU] Damn. [grunts]

399
00:21:13,020 --> 00:21:14,020
Raijin.

400
00:21:18,570 --> 00:21:20,360
[Yuru grunting]

401
00:21:25,620 --> 00:21:27,740
I heard you were
a piece of work.

402
00:21:27,870 --> 00:21:29,580
But you're a real savage.

403
00:21:29,700 --> 00:21:31,410
Even with a kid's life
on the line,

404
00:21:31,540 --> 00:21:32,580
you went for the neck.

405
00:21:33,210 --> 00:21:35,750
Now, hey. Let's all relax.

406
00:21:35,880 --> 00:21:37,880
It's not too late
to have a calm chat.

407
00:21:38,260 --> 00:21:40,420
We're actually civilized
down here,

408
00:21:40,550 --> 00:21:42,800
unlike you primitive
mountain folk.

409
00:21:42,930 --> 00:21:45,760
Let's solve this with our words.

410
00:21:46,510 --> 00:21:48,020
[laughs]

411
00:21:48,140 --> 00:21:49,560
Can't tell by looking at me,

412
00:21:49,680 --> 00:21:52,020
but I'm really
a pacifist at heart.

413
00:21:52,770 --> 00:21:54,480
[Yuru breathes shakily]

414
00:21:54,810 --> 00:21:57,400
[♪ closing theme song playing]

415
00:23:27,870 --> 00:23:30,870
[YURU] This old guy's daemons
can control lightning and wind!

416
00:23:30,990 --> 00:23:34,120
[SHINGO] Say hi to my daemons,
Fujin and Raijin.

417
00:23:34,250 --> 00:23:36,920
Let's play nice, buddy-boy.
